---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Startseite"
description: "Der Förderverein der CJD Kita Thorrfalken e.V. unterstützt Kinder und Familien in Bergheim-Thorr."
---

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
     HERO
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-sand via-amber/30 to-cta/20 pt-20 pb-32">
  <div class="container-default relative z-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <!-- Logo accent -->
      <div class="mb-6 animate-on-scroll flex justify-center">
        <img src="/assets/images/logo.svg" alt="Logo Förderverein CJD Kita Thorrfalken" class="w-36 h-36" />
      </div>
      <h1 class="mb-6 animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
        Kleine Falken,<br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="text-terra">große Träume</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brown/80 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
        Wir unterstützen die CJD Thorrfalken: Ob Klettergerüste, Ausflüge oder Soforthilfe
        für Familien – Ihre Spende landet direkt im Nest.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.3s">
        <a href="/spenden/" class="btn-primary text-base px-8 py-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/>
          </svg>
          Jetzt spenden
        </a>
        <a href="/projekte/" class="btn-secondary text-base px-8 py-4">Unsere Projekte →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Wave divider -->
  <div class="wave-divider absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 80" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
      <path d="M0 80L48 69.3C96 58.7 192 37.3 288 32C384 26.7 480 37.3 576 42.7C672 48 768 48 864 42.7C960 37.3 1056 26.7 1152 24C1248 21.3 1344 26.7 1392 29.3L1440 32V80H1392C1344 80 1248 80 1152 80C1056 80 960 80 864 80C768 80 672 80 576 80C480 80 384 80 288 80C192 80 96 80 48 80H0Z" fill="#F2E2C4"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
     WOFÜR WIR FLIEGEN
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-sand">
  <div class="container-default">
    <div class="section-title animate-on-scroll">
      <h2>Wofür wir fliegen</h2>
      <p>Als Förderverein setzen wir uns für das Wohlergehen jedes kleinen Falken ein.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

      <!-- Feature 1 -->
      <div class="card card-inner text-center animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="feature-icon mx-auto">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3">Projekte &amp; Ausrüstung</h3>
        <p class="text-brown/70 text-sm">Von neuen Spielgeräten über Bastelmaterial bis hin zu Ausflügen – wir finanzieren, was das Nest braucht.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2 -->
      <div class="card card-inner text-center animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
        <div class="feature-icon mx-auto">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18 18.72a9.094 9.094 0 003.741-.479 3 3 0 00-4.682-2.72m.94 3.198l.001.031c0 .225-.012.447-.037.666A11.944 11.944 0 0112 21c-2.17 0-4.207-.576-5.963-1.584A6.062 6.062 0 016 18.719m12 0a5.971 5.971 0 00-.941-3.197m0 0A5.995 5.995 0 0012 12.75a5.995 5.995 0 00-5.058 2.772m0 0a3 3 0 00-4.681 2.72 8.986 8.986 0 003.74.477m.94-3.197a5.971 5.971 0 00-.94 3.197M15 6.75a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0zm-13.5 0a2.25 2.25 0 11-4.5 0 2.25 2.25 0 014.5 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3">Gemeinschaft stärken</h3>
        <p class="text-brown/70 text-sm">Wir verbinden Familien, Erzieherinnen und Unterstützer zu einer lebendigen Gemeinschaft rund ums Nest.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3 -->
      <div class="card card-inner text-center animate-on-scroll" style="animation-delay:0.2s">
        <div class="feature-icon mx-auto">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-3">Soforthilfe für Familien</h3>
        <p class="text-brown/70 text-sm">In besonderen Situationen helfen wir Familien unbürokratisch und schnell, damit kein Kind zurückbleibt.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
     AKTUELLE PROJEKTE
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-amber/10">
  <div class="container-default">
    <div class="section-title animate-on-scroll">
      <h2>Aktuelle Aktionen</h2>
      <p>Was wir zuletzt für unsere kleinen Falken bewegt haben.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-10">
      {% for post in collections.projekte | limit(2) %}
        {% set post = post %}
        {% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="text-center animate-on-scroll">
      <a href="/projekte/" class="btn-secondary">Alle Projekte ansehen →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
     SPONSOREN CAROUSEL
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-sand">
  <div class="container-default">
    <div class="section-title animate-on-scroll">
      <h2>Unsere Unterstützer</h2>
      <p>Herzlichen Dank allen, die unser Nest tragen.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-hidden relative">
      <!-- Fade edges -->
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-sand to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-20 bg-gradient-to-l from-sand to-transparent z-10 pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="flex">
        <div class="carousel-track">
          {% for sponsor in sponsors %}
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/60 rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 border border-amber/30 shrink-0">
              {% if sponsor.logo %}
                <img src="{{ sponsor.logo }}" alt="{{ sponsor.name }}" class="h-8 object-contain" />
              {% else %}
                <span class="text-4xl">🤲</span>
              {% endif %}
              <span class="font-semibold text-brown whitespace-nowrap">{{ sponsor.name }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
          {# Duplicate for seamless loop #}
          {% for sponsor in sponsors %}
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/60 rounded-2xl px-6 py-4 border border-amber/30 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
              {% if sponsor.logo %}
                <img src="{{ sponsor.logo }}" alt="{{ sponsor.name }}" class="h-8 object-contain" />
              {% else %}
                <span class="text-4xl">🤲</span>
              {% endif %}
              <span class="font-semibold text-brown whitespace-nowrap">{{ sponsor.name }}</span>
            </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
     PRE-FOOTER CTA – UNTERSTÜTZEN
══════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section bg-gradient-to-br from-terra/90 to-brown text-sand">
  <div class="container-default">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center animate-on-scroll">
      <div class="text-5xl mb-6">🏠</div>
      <h2 class="text-sand mb-4">Möchten Sie uns unterstützen?</h2>
      <p class="text-sand/80 text-lg mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Jede Spende – ob groß oder klein – landet direkt im Nest und stärkt unsere kleinen Falken.
        Werden Sie Mitglied oder spenden Sie einmalig.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-10">

        <!-- PayPal -->
        <a href="{{ site.paypalLink }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-3xl p-6 border border-sand/20
                  transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 group text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">💙</div>
          <p class="font-bold text-sand mb-1">PayPal</p>
          <p class="text-sand/70 text-sm">Schnell &amp; sicher spenden</p>
        </a>

        <!-- IBAN -->
        <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-3xl p-6 border border-sand/20 text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">🏦</div>
          <p class="font-bold text-sand mb-1">Überweisung</p>
          <p class="font-mono text-cta text-sm break-all">{{ site.iban }}</p>
          <p class="text-sand/60 text-xs mt-1">{{ site.bank }}</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Mitgliedschaft -->
        <a href="/downloads/"
           class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-3xl p-6 border border-sand/20
                  transition-all duration-200 hover:scale-105 group text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-3">📋</div>
          <p class="font-bold text-sand mb-1">Mitglied werden</p>
          <p class="text-sand/70 text-sm">Aufnahmeantrag herunterladen</p>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
